        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "Formatting"
        }
      ],
      "_anchor": "formatting"
    },
    {
      "_type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "`formatOptions` takes the options of `Intl.NumberFormat`, such as a currency or a unit, and the number is shown and parsed in the locale of the dashboard. Digits are not grouped by default, since number fields often hold years or ids: pass `formatOptions={{useGrouping: true}}` to show `1,250` rather than `1250`. The value is a number, or `null` when the field is empty."
        }
      ]
    },
